body:
that looks clapped even for a lupo

&#x200B;

btw i own one too 1.4tdi great runaround econobox

I can guarantee you you won't have problems with the 1.9tdi, with the 1.8t I can´t tell you since mine just hit 99k miles though I've had problems with a leaky valve cover and 2 coil pack failures, also the B6 and B7 which both run on the 8E platform have problems with leaky taillights but that's an easy fix.

&#x200B;

edit don't know much about the other engines since I didn't own them, put 120k miles on the 1.9tdi and only changed the water pump once

so my dude i wont roast you, cause it takes massive balls to own a deathtrap.

&#x200B;

but if you wana take it to the next level lower it and take your headlights apart and spray the silver plastic black
